# ==============================================================================
# NAME: China Mainland Internet Services Rule-Set (China.list)
# DESCRIPTION: Comprehensive, deduplicated collection of China Mainland internet
#              services, tech giants, domestic cloud/CDN, banking, e-commerce,
#              streaming, gaming, domestic AI/LLMs, direct mirrors & PT sites.
#              Note: Since DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cn is declared in Section 1, redundant
#              *.cn / *.com.cn entries are omitted to maximize Surge efficiency.
# UPDATED: 2026-10
# USAGE IN SURGE (Surge.conf):
#   RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/zezetata/Proxyer/master/China.list,DIRECT
# ==============================================================================

